ing classes guns and gear in a  fast-paced fight is a whole new  experience  in tom plancy gaming  we are super stoked by what we've  accomplished so far  and i couldn't be more proud of our  incredible team  we want to personally thank everyone  that's worked so hard during the  pandemic to keep the momentum going on  this game  we understand that it's been even harder  for some of you we hope that we can  build a community that's a place where  people can connect and have fun  and we're committed to creating a  welcoming game based on fair play and  transparency whether you're playing  casually or pushing yourself  competitively  the game's still in early development  but we're gearing up to let you in as  soon as possible  so register right now to participate in  our early rollout phases  thank you so much for watching we really  want your input  so please reach out to us on social  media  [Music]

